     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks like it might be a mistake.\n\n**Amlodipine 50 mg is 5 times the usual maximum dose.** The normal adult range is 2.5\u201310 mg by mouth once daily, and the maximum is 10 mg/day. A 50 mg dose could cause severe low blood pressure and shock, and there's no antidote that reliably reverses an amlodipine overdose. It may be a typo for **5 mg**, which is a standard starting dose.\n\nWhich do you want?\n\n1. **Amlodipine 5 mg by mouth once daily.** I can enter this right away.\n2. **A different dose within 2.5\u201310 mg.**\n3. **50 mg as written.** If this is really what you want, please confirm and give a brief clinical reason. I'll put it in the order note so pharmacy can see it when they verify.\n\nOnce you reply, I'll enter the order."
      }
     ],
